      "name": "dsh-drawio-chat",
      "title": {
        "en": "Draw.io Chat",
        "zh": "Draw.io 聊天图表"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Chat-first draw.io diagrams: describe the diagram you want and an interactive draw.io canvas appears in the transcript — with 12 built-in Chinese scenario templates (login, approval, checkout, CI/CD, architecture, ER, sequence, swimlane…), follow-up edits and undo on the same .drawio file, and .drawio files previewed in the right sidebar instead of raw XML. No draw.io account, no MCP server, no local editor.",
        "zh": "聊天里直接出 draw.io 图：用自然语言描述需求，对话中出现可交互的 draw.io 画布；内置 12 个中文场景模板（登录/审批/下单/CI-CD/架构/ER/时序/泳道…），之后可继续改图、撤销同一个 .drawio 文件，右侧栏直接预览 .drawio 而不是 XML。不登录 draw.io、不需要 MCP server、不用装本地编辑器。"
      },
      "author": "xuedipiaofei",
